                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "8e098bad-1328-45cc-ae75-482c2136501c",
                                "sense_id": "a7d9b470-ee43-373d-86e2-6d6968ace30f",
                                "text": "Were it not for this absorption, the full strength of ultraviolet radiation alone would destroy all living things on earth by what could be referred to roughly as a superextreme sunburn."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "fbe2b433-1b41-4337-b220-4cc99bae0208",
                                "sense_id": "a7d9b470-ee43-373d-86e2-6d6968ace30f",
                                "text": "Working under such limited circumstances it then is pure chance when we spot a chemical that is not superextreme in its harmful potency."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4992f151-92b1-41ae-8a11-c0802a3cf167",
                                "sense_id": "a7d9b470-ee43-373d-86e2-6d6968ace30f",
                                "text": "As in any other case, nationalism has not grown out of nothing here. It shoudl be stressed once again that the years of stagnation have left their mark. During the war, for instance, under superextreme conditions, people could go without sleep for days on end."
